  "about": "SX-1 (Akos N-2b, N-2e). Akos's proposed role table (\"Proposed role access (for N-2)\", Health ID EHR QA, Doctor role, 17 November 2026), checked in so a jest test (services/identity-api/src/auth/role-matrix.spec.ts) can compare it with the role rows the migrations seed today. todayRolePermissions pins every seeded permission of each role named here, and todayDifferences records every difference between today's grants and the table. Both must change in the same pull request as any migration that adds or removes a role_permissions row for these roles; the test fails otherwise. The table is a starting point for the owner to confirm; nothing here changes what any role can do.",
